<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεσφορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring fruit to perfection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.7.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				8.14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεσφορουμένων καρπῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of young
			women, <i>bear perfect offspring</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. καὶ μὴ ἀποβάλλειν τὸ
				ἔμβρυον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.97
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of the offspring, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				7.220c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> generally,
				<i>bring to a head</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔαρ ἐς
				κορυφὴν τ. [νοῦσον</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.31
			</span></i> O.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be brought to perfection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				14.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pay toll</i> or <i>custom</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				3.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τελεσφόφος</span> (<i><span class="en">
				111.2
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				4837
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>), in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φορέντες</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Africa Italiana</u>
				2.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				153
			</span></i> (ibid.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
